(7610062, 1231094, 124815, '<td valign="top">Am glad that you posted the one in color.. the idea behind the construction/destruction/decomposing and recreating is highly enhanced by the viciousness of the colors. The B&amp;H is too mild for the purpose. At least thats my interpretation.</td>', 'Am glad that you posted the one in color.. the idea behind the construction/destruction/decomposing and recreating is highly enhanced by the viciousness of the colors. The B&H is too mild for the purpose. At least thats my interpretation.', '2019-01-23 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
